PHASE 1 — DEFINE THE “SOURCE OF TRUTH” (CRITICAL)
//Personality Test Endpoints
GET  /sessions/start
GET  /sessions/:id/progress
POST /personality/start/:sessionId
GET  /personality/next-center/:sessionId
GET  /personality/:sessionId/:center/next
POST /personality/:sessionId/:center/answer
GET  /personality/:sessionId/final

PHASE 2 — MANUAL E2E TEST SCRIPT (YOU FOLLOW THIS EXACTLY)

Run this like QA:

TEST 1 — Fresh User Flow
	1.	Login
	2.	Click Start Assessment

Expected:
✔ Session created
✔ sessionId stored in localStorage
✔ Redirect to personality page

TEST 2 — Stage 2 Entry
✔ nextCenter returns GUT/HEAD/HEART
✔ First question loads
✔ Options show (labels working now)

TEST 3 — Answer Flow
✔ questionIndex increments
✔ next question loads
✔ no duplicate question
✔ no crash at last question

TEST 4 — Center Transition

After ~45 questions:
✔ automatically switches center
✔ questionIndex resets
✔ new center label shows

TEST 5 — Completion

After all centers:
✔ nextCenter returns completed = true
✔ /final endpoint called
✔ result page loads

TEST 6 — Resume
	1.	Refresh browser mid-test

Expected:
✔ sessionId still exists
✔ resumes from correct center
✔ resumes from correct question

PHASE 3 — ADD LOGGING (TEMP BUT POWERFUL)

In frontend:
console.log('SESSION:', this.sessionId);
console.log('CENTER:', this.currentCenter);
console.log('QUESTION:', this.question?.id);
console.log('INDEX:', this.questionIndex);

In backend:
console.log('NEXT CENTER:', nextCenter);
console.log('QUESTION FETCHED:', question?.id);
console.log('ANSWER SAVED:', questionId, rankChoiceId);

